Subject: [PATCH 06/10] vulkan: co-dispatch Llama 2 Q4_0 projections

Add a strict RX 6700 XT opt-in that groups QKV and FFN gate/up Q4_0 matvecs sharing one decode activation into a single Vulkan dispatch. Preserve fallback behavior and record exact group coverage.

